      <para>Which of the following is the equation of the graph provided?</para>
      <para>
          <media alt="GRAPH OF A DECREASING EXPONENTIAL FUNCTION WITH \(y\)-intercepts OF 1 AND PASSING THROUGH THE POINT (1, 0.333). THE POINT (1, 0.333) IS LABELED.">
